@coderabbitai Addressed both findings in `.agents/scripts/runtime-registry.sh:373`: the non-interactive filter now excludes `github run` and the `pr` launcher while preserving optional global flags, existing exclusions, and standalone child TUI detection. Verified the command names with installed OpenCode 1.19.5 help.

Pushed through `4648b556e`, preserving the concurrent identical fix already on the PR branch. Verification: `bash tests/test-runtime-registry.sh` (52 passed), 18 targeted classification/boundary cases, `bash -n .agents/scripts/runtime-registry.sh`, and `git diff --check`. Standalone ShellCheck was unavailable (missing underlying binary); push hooks deferred TypeScript checks to CI because `tsc` is not installed.

